      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْوِدٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْوَدَ</span>, q. v.:] with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, i. e.
